  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your leg muscles and tendons are replaced with machines powered by hydraulics which can adjust to swift movements and sudden falls. At tier 2, your hydraulic legs are weaponized pistons that can transmit tremendous amounts of kinetic energy. At tier 3, automatically adjusting spike hand grips assure that you can move across any surface at any angle.</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\"><strong>Tier 1. </strong>Your movement speed increases by 10 feet and your jump distance is tripled. When you fall, you can use your reaction to take no damage from falling. Making a standing long jump no longer reduces the distance you can jump.</p>",
      "chat": "",
      "unidentified": ""
    },
